    <div class="verify-note">Scene confirmed: cabin interior with the dark monster, the hiding man, laptop, headphones, radio, antlers and the stove pipe. The first four moves are easy to read on screen (speaker clicked at 0:10, window at 0:20, laptop at 0:30, headphones at 0:40) and 'Completed' lands at 2:25. Timestamps ±5 s.</div>
